OL,3,GNEWSAHelping families affected by
OL,4,Acancer after son's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FJoanne McNulty said: "We went down to
OL,7,Fthe hospital four times because he
OL,8,F[Callum] had a pain in his back and
OL,9,Fthey kept sending them away because he
OL,10,Fwas so active... that's what they put
OL,11,Fthe pain down to."
OL,13,FThe Health Department has been
OL,14,Fapproached for comment.
